Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: enable the guacamole speaker parent bus

The enabled i2c4 speaker codecs cannot probe while their QUP0 wrapper
is disabled. Restore the parent status from the working 6.17 tree.

Nura-Category: device-dt
Nura-Origin: nura local
Upstream-Status: n/a: guacamole DTS is not upstream

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8150-oneplus-guacamole-nura.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8150-oneplus-guacamole-nura.dtsi
@@ -262,6 +262,10 @@
 	vdd-io-supply = <&vreg_s4a_1p8>;
 };
 
+&qupv3_id_0 {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
 &i2c4 {
 	status = "okay";
 	clock-frequency = <100000>;
